  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a7ca2ec12b37586",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 提供了 Hub 平台，让你能够轻松上传、分享和部署模型。它为开发者节省了从头训练模型所需的时间和计算资源。不过，在实际生产环境中部署模型，或以云原生方式部署模型，仍然可能面临挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ad900941442278b",
      "translationZh": "这正是 BentoML 发挥作用的地方。BentoML 是一个用于机器学习模型服务与部署的开源平台。它是一个统一框架，用于构建、交付和扩展可用于生产环境的 AI 应用，这些应用可整合传统模型、预训练模型、生成式模型以及大语言模型。从整体上看，使用 BentoML 框架的流程如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b36721bace6a811",
      "translationZh": "定义模型：在使用 BentoML 之前，你需要一个机器学习模型（或多个模型）。这个模型可以使用 TensorFlow 和 PyTorch 等机器学习库进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da20f1a1ba9f0141",
      "translationZh": "保存模型：获得训练好的模型后，将其保存到 BentoML 本地 Model Store 中。Model Store 用于在本地管理所有已训练的模型，并在提供模型服务时访问这些模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3fd89bfa8a4f1744",
      "translationZh": "创建 BentoML Service：创建一个 service.py 文件来封装模型并定义服务逻辑。该文件为模型指定 Runners，以便大规模运行模型推理，并暴露 API 来定义如何处理输入和输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75753b7d90462e02",
      "translationZh": "构建 Bento：通过创建一个 YAML 配置文件，将所有模型和 Service 打包成一个 Bento，即包含全部代码和依赖项的可部署制品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25bf7f6f464eb6b3",
      "translationZh": "部署 Bento：Bento 准备就绪后，你可以将其容器化，创建 Docker 镜像并在 Kubernetes 上运行。或者，也可以将 Bento 直接部署到 Yatai。Yatai 是一个开源的端到端解决方案，用于在 Kubernetes 上自动化并大规模运行机器学习部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8e6920d03fb0265",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客文章中，我们将按照上述工作流程，演示如何将 DeepFloyd IF 与 BentoML 集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e331da0741fb6d05",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb7f9d806986029e",
      "translationZh": "DeepFloyd IF 简介",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0ad9007c3acf4bf",
      "translationZh": "准备环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8fac606a306bdc76",
      "translationZh": "将模型下载到 BentoML Model Store",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0326e38c85d33929",
      "translationZh": "启动 BentoML Service",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bafa47ecc59fb61a",
      "translationZh": "构建 Bento 并提供服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b10f7571f1e8b20",
      "translationZh": "测试服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eaf380e7f60489b7",
      "translationZh": "后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bb7f9d806986029e",
      "translationZh": "DeepFloyd IF 简介",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d746a7020a80979a",
      "translationZh": "DeepFloyd IF 是一种先进的开源文本生成图像模型。它采用独特的运行策略和架构，有别于 Stable Diffusion 等潜在扩散模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de6050efab9e5f14",
      "translationZh": "DeepFloyd IF 具有高度的照片真实感和出色的语言理解能力。与 Stable Diffusion 不同，DeepFloyd IF 直接在像素空间中运行，采用模块化结构，包含一个冻结的文本编码器和三个级联的像素扩散模块。每个模块在流程中各司其职：Stage 1 负责生成一张基础的 64x64 px 图像，随后通过 Stage 2 和 Stage 3 逐步将其放大至 1024x1024 px。DeepFloyd IF 的另一个关键独特之处在于，它集成了一个大语言模型（T5-XXL-1.1）来编码提示词，从而能够更好地理解复杂提示词。更多信息，请参阅 Stability AI 这篇关于 DeepFloyd IF 的博客文章。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1228c83f53093f1",
      "translationZh": "为确保你的 DeepFloyd IF 应用在生产环境中高性能运行，你可能需要合理分配和管理资源。在这方面，BentoML 允许你针对每个 Stage 独立扩缩 Runners。例如，你可以为 Stage 1 Runners 使用更多 Pods，或为它们分配更强大的 GPU 服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e0ad9007c3acf4bf",
      "translationZh": "准备环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96595fbf2a86bc9c",
      "translationZh": "此 GitHub 仓库存储了本项目所需的全部文件。要在本地运行此项目，请确保具备以下条件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1358e5fc2e9b6c0a",
      "translationZh": "已安装 pip",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "072215fc5304f341",
      "translationZh": "至少需要 2 块各配备 16GB 显存的 GPU，或 1 块配备 40 显存的 GPU。在本项目中，我们使用了 Google Cloud 的 n1-standard-16 类型机器，配备 64 GB 内存和 2 块 NVIDIA T4 GPU。请注意，虽然可以在单块 T4 上运行 IF，但不建议将其用于生产级服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e67ba3d7d94ef251",
      "translationZh": "满足先决条件后，将项目仓库克隆到本地机器，并进入目标目录。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0966378389bf342",
      "translationZh": "在构建应用程序之前，让我们先简要了解一下此目录中的关键文件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1949119873f80deb",
      "translationZh": "import_models.py：定义 IFPipeline 各个阶段的模型。你可以使用此文件将所有模型下载到本地机器，以便将它们打包到单个 Bento 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a47f9a4a2bc68c0",
      "translationZh": "requirements.txt：定义本项目所需的所有软件包和依赖项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ab92a75567ee46d3",
      "translationZh": "service.py：定义一个 BentoML Service，其中包含三个使用 to_runner 方法创建的 Runner，并对外提供用于生成图像的 API。该 API 接收一个 JSON 对象作为输入（即提示词和负向提示词），并通过依次使用一系列模型，返回一张图像作为输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c25af201d6827f2d",
      "translationZh": "start-server.py：通过 service.py 中定义的 Service 启动 BentoML HTTP 服务器，并创建一个 Gradio Web 界面，供用户输入提示词以生成图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51ee9c9c41dad72d",
      "translationZh": "bentofile.yaml：定义待构建 Bento 的元数据，包括 Service、Python 软件包和模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c090c38ef25bc071",
      "translationZh": "我们建议你创建一个虚拟环境，以隔离依赖项。例如，运行以下命令来激活 myenv：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c59bed71d9bb1a51",
      "translationZh": "安装所需的依赖项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c6eb8bfdd53cce7",
      "translationZh": "如果你之前没有使用命令行从 Hugging Face 下载过模型，则必须先登录：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8fac606a306bdc76",
      "translationZh": "将模型下载到 BentoML Model Store",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee5d1527c9b2020f",
      "translationZh": "如上所述，你需要下载 DeepFloyd IF 各个阶段所使用的所有模型。设置好环境后，运行以下命令，将模型下载到本地模型存储中。此过程可能需要一些时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa5b83685ccf7948",
      "translationZh": "下载完成后，查看模型存储中的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0326e38c85d33929",
      "translationZh": "启动 BentoML 服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f109d521094fb36e",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用 start-server.py 文件直接运行 BentoML HTTP 服务器，并提供由 Gradio 驱动的 Web 用户界面；该文件是此应用的入口点。它提供了多种选项，用于自定义执行方式以及管理不同阶段之间的 GPU 分配。你可以根据自己的 GPU 配置使用不同的命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b0fcdeac85701a1",
      "translationZh": "对于显存超过 40GB 的 GPU，在同一块 GPU 上运行所有模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc0484f3e4b3d1a4",
      "translationZh": "对于两块各配备 15GB 显存的 Tesla T4，将 Stage 1 模型分配到第一块 GPU，将 Stage 2 和 Stage 3 模型分配到第二块 GPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6829105e26616a77",
      "translationZh": "对于一块配备 15GB 显存的 Tesla T4 和另外两块显存较小的 GPU，将 Stage 1 模型分配到 T4，将 Stage 2 和 Stage 3 模型分别分配到第二块和第三块 GPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d29ab00f62cea32",
      "translationZh": "要查看所有可自定义的选项（例如服务器端口），请运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6b10f7571f1e8b20",
      "translationZh": "测试服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6bbf65ddc4b6a52",
      "translationZh": "服务器启动后，你可以访问 http://localhost:7860 打开 Web 界面。BentoML API 端点也可通过 http://localhost:3000 访问。以下是提示词和负面提示词的示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35261535449d29f8",
      "translationZh": "提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0ceb34091634d3f",
      "translationZh": "橙色与黑色，站在路灯下的一名女性的头部特写，暗色主题，Frank Miller，电影，超写实，氛围，极其细致且繁复，极度逼真，8k 分辨率，照片级真实感，丰富的纹理，繁复的细节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93c9b9d35567cc64",
      "translationZh": "负面提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63c7111619fe9903",
      "translationZh": "平铺，画得不好的手，画得不好的脚，画得不好的脸，超出画面，变异，发生变异的，多余的肢体，多余的腿，多余的手臂，容貌畸形，形体畸形，斗鸡眼，身体超出画面，模糊，糟糕的画作，不合理的人体结构，模糊不清，文字，水印，颗粒感",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccfbca6507781cd9",
      "translationZh": "结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bafa47ecc59fb61a",
      "translationZh": "构建 Bento 并提供服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "008013ef51e9cf0f",
      "translationZh": "现在你已成功在本地运行 DeepFloyd IF，可以在项目目录中运行以下命令，将其打包为 Bento。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42d5bcf48a6d8156",
      "translationZh": "在本地 Bento Store 中查看该 Bento。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c153a2ca1660747",
      "translationZh": "该 Bento 现在已准备好在生产环境中提供服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3555de78a42a6308",
      "translationZh": "要以更云原生的方式部署该 Bento，请运行以下命令生成 Docker 镜像：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b20977fefd16a460",
      "translationZh": "然后，你就可以将模型部署到 Kubernetes 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7ad7aa27712dc30e",
      "translationZh": "接下来呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca7fe8ea8fc3ca33",
      "translationZh": "BentoML 提供了一种功能强大且简单直接的方式，可将 Hugging Face 模型部署到生产环境中。它支持广泛的机器学习框架，并提供易于使用的 API，让你能够快速将模型投入生产。无论你使用的是 DeepFloyd IF 模型，还是 Hugging Face Model Hub 上的任何其他模型，BentoML 都能帮助你让模型真正发挥作用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
